  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - Strongly-typed pagination metadata. BREAKING CHANGES: IPaginationMetadataFactory.CreateMetadata() now returns PaginationMeta instead of object; Pagination extensions now use PaginationMeta directly (no anonymous object wrapper). NEW FEATURES: Add PaginationMeta class for strongly-typed pagination metadata; Improved Swagger/OpenAPI schema generation for pagination. MIGRATION: Custom IPaginationMetadataFactory implementations must return PaginationMeta. Requires SuccessHound 2.0.0 and SuccessHound.AspNetExtensions 2.0.0. See README for migration examples.",
